  "description": "Yoo Bumi was dumped by her fiancé at the tail end of her twenties because she was \"boring.\" Trapped suddenly in a warehouse, she discovers a wish-granting staff and makes a contract with the fairy Nemesis. Because Bumi keeps making trivial wishes one after another, Nemesis's magic is running dry, forcing him to begin a manual magic supply...\n\n \"My ugly little human. Desire anything by my side.\"\n\n**Original Webtoon:**    \n[Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/desiderium), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/Desiderium)",
